    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual novel adaptation of The Communist Manifesto by Karl Marx and Friedrich Engels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the Manifesto in a conversational style and choose your own topics to focus on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose whether to ask Engels for footnotes. Unlock the ending after reading Chapters 1, 2, and 3.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get more detail about the vocabulary used in the glossary and track your completion of the glossary to unlock extra features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock extra features including music, introductions, postscript, backgrounds, and the image gallery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what music to play from the soundtrack using the Music Select menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 19th century paintings related to locations and events of the Manifesto and its authors to display as backgrounds during your reading.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your reading experience further by turning off choice menus, music changes, and animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and view images of the authors, drawings of them, and sketches by Engels.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual novel adaptation of The Communist Manifesto by Karl Marx and Friedrich Engels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the Manifesto in a conversational style and choose your own topics to focus on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose whether to ask Engels for footnotes. Unlock the ending after reading Chapters 1, 2, and 3.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get more detail about the vocabulary used in the glossary and track your completion of the glossary to unlock extra features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock extra features including music, introductions, postscript, backgrounds, and the image gallery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what music to play from the soundtrack using the Music Select menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 19th century paintings related to locations and events of the Manifesto and its authors to display as backgrounds during your reading.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your reading experience further by turning off choice menus, music changes, and animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and view images of the authors, drawings of them, and sketches by Engels.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The visual novel adaptation of The Communist Manifesto by Karl Marx and Friedrich Engels. Experience the Manifesto in a conversational style for the first time and fully customize your reading.",
